; pip.tscn — the Room 1 kitten NPC (grants Jump via dialogue).
; This is the VISUAL only (idle animation + face-the-player). Drop it as a CHILD
; of an interactable so the dialogue/trigger and the looks stay aligned. To make
; another NPC: duplicate this scene, swap the SpriteFrames frames. See npc.gd.
;
; TREE:
;   Pip (Node2D, npc.gd)
;   └── AnimatedSprite2D (plays "idle")

